[00:20.86]1. Ever loyal to Jehovah,
[00:26.84]Loyal love we wish to show.
[00:32.70]As a people, dedicated,
[00:38.90]His commands we want to know.
[00:45.28]His advice will never fail us,
[00:51.78]And his counsel we obey.
[00:58.34]He is loyal; we can trust him.
[01:04.54]From his side we’ll never stray.
[01:22.06]2. Ever loyal to our brothers,
[01:26.64]Sticking close in times of need.
[01:33.18]Ever caring, always trusting,
[01:39.04]Ever kind in word and deed.
[01:45.04]We show honor to our brothers
[01:51.50]And respect them from the heart.
[01:58.58]Ever loyal, ever closer,
[02:04.50]From their side we’ll never part.
[03:06.40]3. Ever loyal to their guidance
[03:12.58]When our brothers lead the way.
[03:18.80]When they give us clear direction,
[03:24.94]May we loyally obey.
[03:31.00]Then the blessing from Jehovah
[03:37.14]Will be ours to make us strong.
[03:43.58]When we’re loyal, ever faithful,
[03:49.80]To Jehovah we’ll belong.
